@startuml
title SPECTATOR Role - StateChart

skinparam monochrome true
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam linetype ortho
skinparam roundcorner 0
top to bottom direction

skinparam nodesep 100
skinparam ranksep 120
skinparam wrapWidth 200
skinparam defaultTextAlignment center
skinparam Padding 14
skinparam ArrowFontSize 11

skinparam state {
  FontSize 13
  FontStyle bold
}

state "Logged Out" as LoggedOut
state "Browse Public Information" as PublicBrowsing
state "Login Failed" as LoginFailed
state "Spectator Dashboard" as Dashboard
state "View Tournament List" as TournamentList
state "View Tournament Details" as TournamentDetail
state "View Race List" as RaceList
state "View Race Details" as RaceDetail
state "Wait for Published Results" as WaitingForResult
state "View Race Results" as PublishedResult
state "View Leaderboard" as Leaderboard
state "View Notifications" as Notifications

[*] -down-> LoggedOut

LoggedOut -down-> PublicBrowsing : Browse tournaments and races
PublicBrowsing -up-> LoggedOut : Return

LoggedOut -down-> Dashboard : Sign in\n[valid credentials and ACTIVE account]
LoggedOut -right-> LoginFailed : Invalid credentials or\naccount is not ACTIVE
LoginFailed -left-> LoggedOut : Retry

Dashboard -down-> TournamentList : Open tournaments
TournamentList -down-> TournamentDetail : Select tournament
TournamentDetail -down-> RaceList : View races
RaceList -down-> RaceDetail : Select race

RaceDetail -down-> WaitingForResult : Results are not published
WaitingForResult -down-> PublishedResult : Race becomes COMPLETED
RaceDetail -right-> PublishedResult : Results are published
PublishedResult -down-> Leaderboard : Open leaderboard

Leaderboard -up-> PublishedResult : Return
PublishedResult -up-> RaceDetail : Return
RaceDetail -up-> RaceList : Return
RaceList -up-> TournamentDetail : Return
TournamentDetail -up-> TournamentList : Return
TournamentList -up-> Dashboard : Return to dashboard

Dashboard -right-> Notifications : Open notifications
Notifications -left-> Dashboard : Mark as read / return

Dashboard -up-> LoggedOut : Sign out or token expires

note right of PublishedResult
  Spectators can view official results only
  when the race status is COMPLETED.
end note

@enduml
